{"version":1,"key":"card:686","content":{"id":686,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"57c65a5c-12a6-45df-9252-914a093b19fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JavaScript 中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"instanceof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 操作符的内部原理就是检查改对象的构造函数的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prototype"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是否在改对象的原型链上"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"","uuid":"1ee80bf3-82e8-4c94-859a-e20976ef7f84","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1fadae13-eef2-4c56-aff2-2b14461dc3af","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"┌─────────────────┐\n│   对象 (object)  │\n│  ┌───────────┐  │\n│  │ __proto__ │──┼──┐\n│  └───────────┘  │  │\n└─────────────────┘  │\n                     ▼\n              ┌─────────────┐\n              │  原型对象 A  │◄── Constructor.prototype\n              │  ┌─────────┐│\n              │  │__proto__│┼──┐\n              │  └─────────┘│  │\n              └─────────────┘  │\n                               ▼\n                        ┌─────────────┐\n                        │  原型对象 B  │\n                        │  ┌─────────┐│\n                        │  │__proto__│┼──► null\n                        │  └─────────┘│\n                        └─────────────┘","collabId":"0c0e570a-abec-4e5d-bfaa-a36e50e79157","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"36edca48-44ae-441d-b600-f3cd8d099033","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个可参考的内部实现："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JAVASCRIPT","uuid":"a98d14a2-29aa-45e2-916d-83dfe0e1b8a4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5cec1987-bb25-4035-9e8f-da5184398993","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function myInstanceOf(obj, constructor) {\n    // 获取对象的隐式原型\n    let proto = Object.getPrototypeOf(obj);\n    \n    // 沿着原型链向上查找\n    while (proto !== null) {\n        // 检查是否匹配构造函数的 prototype\n        if (proto === constructor.prototype) {\n            return true;\n        }\n        // 继续向上查找\n        proto = Object.getPrototypeOf(proto);\n    }\n    \n    return false;\n}","collabId":"cc1c82d0-947b-4063-b7a6-181cef877f58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a244afd6-8e20-41cd-b813-fecbd48571cc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了深刻的理解，可以看一下下面的例子，通过手动构建原型链而不是构造函数，来验证上述逻辑，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"instaceof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 只认 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prototype"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即使不是通过构建函数创建的对象，只要在原型链上就行"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JAVASCRIPT","uuid":"574a46f1-ba74-46bc-af63-a2dd3e0524bf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1d5bfde3-9151-41fd-9297-2cae0747c58b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function Animal() {}\n\n// 手动创建对象，指定原型\nconst cat = Object.create(Animal.prototype);\n\n// instanceof 正常工作\nconsole.log(cat instanceof Animal);  // true ✓\nconsole.log(cat instanceof Object);  // true ✓","collabId":"cb55066f-1f5f-4642-85cd-1714b0f7ce7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"mermaid","renderStyle":"svg","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","chart":"classDiagram\n    class Animal {\n        +prototype: Animal.prototype\n    }\n    \n    class Animal.prototype {\n        +constructor: Animal\n        +[[Prototype]]: Object.prototype\n    }\n    \n    class cat {\n        +[[Prototype]]: Animal.prototype\n    }\n    \n    class Object.prototype {\n        +toString()\n        +valueOf()\n        +[[Prototype]]: null\n    }\n    \n    Animal --> Animal.prototype : prototype\n    Animal.prototype --> Animal : constructor\n    Animal.prototype --> Object.prototype : [[Prototype]]\n    cat --> Animal.prototype : [[Prototype]]","collabId":"9bceac13-a19d-4f31-b7df-501985d8f510","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/instanceof","JavaScript/原型"],"createTime":1772030473171,"updateTime":1777119473910,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1777119473910}}